<title>MALAYSIA: Maruichi Malaysia Steel net down 2.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Maruichi Malaysia Steel net down 2.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31, 1997</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)    57.0     vs    58.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		44.78    vs    45.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		 431.77    vs   451.59</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  55.96    vs    58.02</p>
<p>    Dividend   (pct)	12.0     vs    12.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of the company is Maruichi Malaysia Steel Tube Bhd. It is involved in the manufacture and trade of steel pipes and tubes and the manufacture of cold rolled steel.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
